# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Momento Landing — LOCAL DEVELOPMENT
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Landing page runs standalone with no required env vars.
# Add variables here as features are added (analytics, etc.)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Uncomment when connecting to the API:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Uncomment when adding analytics:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MIXPANEL_TOKEN=""
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=""
